- **Next step:** deploy `6403DE59`, run `cache_coherency`, grep `P112-IFLUSH-CALLER` — the last caller before the `P109` wedge names the exact path that abandons the flush. Fix that site (or commit to the GFS2-style drain-out-of-BAST re-architecture both AIs recommend).

